{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "PAD Analyzer",
          "version": "0.1.0",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "file-op-no-error-handler",
              "name": "File operation without error handler",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "File operation without error handler"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "File/Folder operations that commonly fail (locks, permissions, missing paths) without an error handler."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "File/Folder operations that commonly fail (locks, permissions, missing paths) without an error handler.\n\nAuto-fix available: wrap-error-handler (apply with `bakicli fix`).\n\nRun `bakicli rules file-op-no-error-handler` for the full rule description.",
                "markdown": "File/Folder operations that commonly fail (locks, permissions, missing paths) without an error handler.\n\nAuto-fix available: wrap-error-handler (apply with `bakicli fix`).\n\nRun `bakicli rules file-op-no-error-handler` for the full rule description."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/dusankuburic/baki#features",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "Reliability",
                "confidence": "medium"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hardcoded-credential",
              "name": "Hardcoded credential detected",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Hardcoded credential detected"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "String values matching credential patterns, and credential-typed action properties (Password, ApiKey, Token, …) set to a literal."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "String values matching credential patterns, and credential-typed action properties (Password, ApiKey, Token, …) set to a literal.\n\nAuto-fix available: replace-with-variable (apply with `bakicli fix`).\n\nRun `bakicli rules hardcoded-credential` for the full rule description.",
                "markdown": "String values matching credential patterns, and credential-typed action properties (Password, ApiKey, Token, …) set to a literal.\n\nAuto-fix available: replace-with-variable (apply with `bakicli fix`).\n\nRun `bakicli rules hardcoded-credential` for the full rule description."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/dusankuburic/baki#features",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "Security",
                "confidence": "high"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hardcoded-filepath",
              "name": "Hardcoded file path",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Hardcoded file path"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Absolute file paths that break when the flow runs on a different machine."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Absolute file paths that break when the flow runs on a different machine.\n\nAuto-fix available: replace-with-variable (apply with `bakicli fix`).\n\nRun `bakicli rules hardcoded-filepath` for the full rule description.",
                "markdown": "Absolute file paths that break when the flow runs on a different machine.\n\nAuto-fix available: replace-with-variable (apply with `bakicli fix`).\n\nRun `bakicli rules hardcoded-filepath` for the full rule description."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/dusankuburic/baki#features",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "Portability",
                "confidence": "low"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "subflow-no-error-handler",
              "name": "Subflow without error handler",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Subflow without error handler"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Non-trivial subflows that contain no error handler block."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Non-trivial subflows that contain no error handler block.\n\nAuto-fix available: wrap-error-handler (apply with `bakicli fix`).\n\nRun `bakicli rules subflow-no-error-handler` for the full rule description.",
                "markdown": "Non-trivial subflows that contain no error handler block.\n\nAuto-fix available: wrap-error-handler (apply with `bakicli fix`).\n\nRun `bakicli rules subflow-no-error-handler` for the full rule description."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/dusankuburic/baki#features",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "Reliability",
                "confidence": "medium"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "todo-in-comment",
              "name": "TODO in comment",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "TODO in comment"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "COMMENT blocks containing TODO, FIXME, XXX, or HACK markers that signal unfinished work."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "COMMENT blocks containing TODO, FIXME, XXX, or HACK markers that signal unfinished work.\n\nAuto-fix available: remove-block (apply with `bakicli fix`).\n\nRun `bakicli rules todo-in-comment` for the full rule description.",
                "markdown": "COMMENT blocks containing TODO, FIXME, XXX, or HACK markers that signal unfinished work.\n\nAuto-fix available: remove-block (apply with `bakicli fix`).\n\nRun `bakicli rules todo-in-comment` for the full rule description."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/dusankuburic/baki#features",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "Style",
                "confidence": "medium"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "unused-variable",
              "name": "Variable declared but never used",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Variable declared but never used"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Variables that are declared but never referenced."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Variables that are declared but never referenced.\n\nAuto-fix available: remove-block (apply with `bakicli fix`).\n\nRun `bakicli rules unused-variable` for the full rule description.",
                "markdown": "Variables that are declared but never referenced.\n\nAuto-fix available: remove-block (apply with `bakicli fix`).\n\nRun `bakicli rules unused-variable` for the full rule description."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/dusankuburic/baki#features",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "Style",
                "confidence": "low"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "wait-zero",
              "name": "Wait zero",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Wait zero"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "WAIT 0 actions that are effectively no-ops and add unnecessary clutter."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "WAIT 0 actions that are effectively no-ops and add unnecessary clutter.\n\nAuto-fix available: remove-block (apply with `bakicli fix`).\n\nRun `bakicli rules wait-zero` for the full rule description.",
                "markdown": "WAIT 0 actions that are effectively no-ops and add unnecessary clutter.\n\nAuto-fix available: remove-block (apply with `bakicli fix`).\n\nRun `bakicli rules wait-zero` for the full rule description."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/dusankuburic/baki#features",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
                "category": "Style",
                "confidence": "medium"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "automationDetails": {
        "id": "pad-analysis"
      },
      "invocations": [
        {
          "executionSuccessful": true
        }
      ],
      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "file-op-no-error-handler",
          "ruleIndex": 0,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "This file/folder operation can fail due to missing files, permission issues, or file locks but has no error handler.\n\nSuggestion: Wrap this action in an 'On Block Error' handler to manage missing files, permission errors, and file lock issues gracefully."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "Main.txt"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 3
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "b-002",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "sf-1/b-002",
                  "kind": "member"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "padFindingId/v1": "c79d4138e9fc38fd"
          }
        },
