          "message": {
            "text": "Variable 'Password' has a name that suggests it holds a credential and is assigned a literal string value.\n\nSuggestion: Store credentials in a secured vault, Windows Credential Manager, or use a PAD input variable instead of a literal string in the flow."
          },
